    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University and English Biscuits signed a memorandum of understanding to expand the neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) at the University Hospital. The MoU was signed today by a representative of English Biscuits and Mr Firoz Rasul, President of the Aga Khan University.",
